faq:
  - q: Is HelioLattice suitable for a small residential installer?
    a: Yes. It is designed for teams handling many home installations, from a handful of staff upwards. You start with the modules you use and add roles as the team grows.
  - q: Can our surveyors work from their phones?
    a: Yes. The survey runs in a mobile browser and captures location, roof, electrical details and photos on site.
  - q: Can we manage subsidy paperwork?
    a: Yes. Utility and subsidy stages are part of your delivery checklist, with documents and owners for each step, and they appear only on jobs where they apply.
  - q: Can we run AMC for our installed customers?
    a: Yes. AMC invoices and receipts, service tickets and service costs are kept on each customer's record.
  - q: Can dealers send us homes to install?
    a: Yes. Dealers and agents use their own portal to submit enquiries, and your team reviews and converts them.
